sequenceDiagram
    participant L as LINE Platform
    participant A as External adapter
    participant P as PRP
    participant S as Artifact access
    participant U as LINE user
    L->>A: Webhook event / raw signature
    Note over L,U: Adapter verifies, deduplicates and commits ingress before HTTP 200; DB failure is not acknowledged as success
    A-->>L: 200 webhook + optional reply ACK
    A->>L: Get authorized audio content
    A->>P: ASR -> client context -> chat -> TTS
    P-->>A: Text + artifact references
    A->>S: Mint policy-approved audio grant
    S-->>A: HTTPS URL / bounded TTL
    A->>L: Push with first-request retry key
    L->>U: Deliver message / fetch media
    Note over L,U: ACK consumed reply token. Push policy/quota required. Unknown send is reconciled; no new inference to repair delivery
